ved bounded-stale until the TTL\nwindow flipped. FieldsHopAnalyzer walks the parsed field paths against the\nschema graph and the interceptor now bypasses ETag caching entirely when a\npath crosses more than one reference hop: always fresh, fail-safe by\nconstruction (unknown segments, nested presets, unresolvable schemas and\nparser failures all opt out). Applies to schema-derived metadata endpoints\nincluding /gist; composite and named-key endpoints keep their hand-curated\ndependency sets. Verdicts are cached in a bounded cache2k cache (1024\nentries) keyed by root type and fields string. New metric\ndhis2_etag_cache_requests_total{result=skip_deep_fields} makes the skip\nrate observable.","author":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"msvanaes@dhis2.org"},"id":"d44b7a7e2ac8fade17a94e798b7041e1c6f485e5","tree_id":"4fb2477e3e111b0665dcdc835d32315a61017f38","timestamp":"2026-07-28T12:49:00Z","committer":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"msvanaes@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/